      "content": "thanks for this. it's a decent start, but i think the leads are gonna find this way too brief. the automated tool is flagging it because the bullet point count is really low compared to what other teams are hitting. \n\ncan you try to expand this a bit? i really don't want you to do that \"tiny step\" thing i mentioned earlier—don't just list out \"open file\" or \"click button\"—but maybe try to be more granular with the actual technical sub-tasks involved in those items? like, instead of just \"fix the error,\" maybe list the specific stages of the fix (analysis, implementation, testing, etc) as separate points so the score goes up a bit more without being totally useless fluff. \n\ncan you give me a revised version with more bullets?",
